  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-sienna pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Unabsorbed Force</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/08/Malphite%2C_Shard_of_the_Monolith_%28League_of_Legends%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180517154233\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Malphite, Shard of the Monolith (League of Legends)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/08/Malphite%2C_Shard_of_the_Monolith_%28League_of_Legends%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180517154233\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/08/Malphite%2C_Shard_of_the_Monolith_%28League_of_Legends%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180517154233 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/08/Malphite%2C_Shard_of_the_Monolith_%28League_of_Legends%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20180517154233 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Malphite, Shard of the Monolith (League of Legends)\" width=\"270\" height=\"159\" data-image-key=\"Malphite%2C_Shard_of_the_Monolith_%28League_of_Legends%29.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Malphite, Shard of the Monolith (League of Legends).jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Malphite's (League of Legends) Unstoppable Force cannot be interrupted, is immune to displacement and cannot be affected by altered by crowd control while active.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Have one's forces be unabsorbed by anything.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>have one's forces be unabsorbed by anything</b>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnabsorbable_Force%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Unabsorbed Movement</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnabsorbable_Force%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can exert forces without having them absorbed by anything that can absorb such forces as well as kinetic energy and momentum, which may include superpowered beings or materials that can absorb such force and energies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnabsorbable_Force%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Be unaffected by...\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Impact_Absorption\" title=\"Impact Absorption\">Impact Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Absorption\">Kinetic Energy Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Motion_Cancellation\" title=\"Motion Cancellation\">Motion Cancellation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Physical_Force_Absorption\" title=\"Physical Force Absorption\">Physical Force Absorption</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnabsorbable_Force%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Acceleration_Manipulation\" title=\"Acceleration Manipulation\">Acceleration Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Explosion_Absorption\" title=\"Explosion Absorption\">Explosion Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Flowmotion\" title=\"Flowmotion\">Flowmotion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Motion_Manipulation\" title=\"Motion Manipulation\">Motion Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Physical_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Physical Force Manipulation\">Physical Force Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Selective_Invulnerability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Selective Invulnerability\">Selective Invulnerability</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Unrestricted_Movement\" title=\"Unrestricted Movement\">Unrestricted Movement</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnabsorbable_Force%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May have a limited as to how much force can't be absorbed.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be limited to some forces or energies.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnabsorbable_Force%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Various Characters with an Unstoppable Dash (<i>League of Legends</i>)\n<ul><li>Malphite, Shard of the Monolith</li>\n<li>Shyvana, the Half-Dragon</li>\n<li>Vi, the Piltover Enforcer</li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260806195902\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 103/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 202/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.561      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%   16.561      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:367986-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260806195902 and revision id 2457517. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
